SUMMARY:Switching Timelines for Permanent Healing with Unconditional Love
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n"Welcome to the re
 al sci-fi!" That's what I felt at my first big spiritual awakening when th
 e Universe told me life is designed to be forever fun and good. I was 24 y
 ears old\, a Star Trek fan terrified of WW3 and climate disaster. Would yo
 u believe that was 39 years ago? No so different from today! It took me de
 cades to understand why reality doesn't become perfect when you've tasted 
 perfection. Depending on your own destiny for the Earth\, you must learn t
 o switch timelines to retrieve more parts of your soul and share the way w
 ith more friends. Many levels of manifestation precede the physical realit
 y\, so let visible miracles come in divine timing when you need them most.
  Don't let a clueless materialistic culture call you crazy when you know t
 he world is different for you. Learn to stay on track to see the future wh
 ere you belong to thrive!\n\nJoin us Sunday Sep 13\, 2026 for a free liber
 ating talk on what it means to go 4d\, jump timelines\, and attain permane
 nt healing. The world isn't what it seems\; it's way waaayyy better! Earth
  is created to be paradise. What makes human life impossibly hard are all 
 the false negative belief systems that tell us the wrong way to live. “D
 on’t love\, be tough\, it’s survival of the fittest out there!” We
 ’re taught to fear and fight many suffering situations that simply aren
 ’t true. This isn’t to say that people don’t experience suffering\, 
 only that the suffering is artificial\, staged\, unnecessary and unsustain
 able.\n\nLike a bad movie\, you can make your life be about any unrealisti
 c unconvincing drama you thought you had to endure. And like a bad movie\,
  there’s nothing really there on the projection screen. Just the prereco
 rded images of belief systems that you still can’t believe are happening
  to you. “This is crazy! This is so unfair! Why won’t it stop?” Beca
 use you must learn how to make it stop\, that’s all. Stop watching\, sto
 p reacting\, stop feeding it with your mind. Walk out\, find a better stor
 y at the multiverse multiplex.\n\nOf course\, switching timelines has to m
 ake sense. The only thing worse than an insane reality is an insane fantas
 y. No matter how bad the world gets\, if you think the alternatives are ri
 diculous or impossible then you won’t be able to change. But it’s gett
 ing hard to justify the comparison\, isn’t it? Reality used to be pretty
  stable and most folks were reasonable. If you were caught in abuse\, at l
 east there were rules that you could hope to change. “Let’s make socie
 ty more fair and just\, let’s inspire each other to improve the technolo
 gy and rule of law!”\n\nWell\, inspiring each other is still valid of co
 urse. But the international bestseller “Future Shock” was published in
  1970\, over 55 years ago. The states of psychological overwhelm in a too-
 fast changing disposable global culture as the book predicted are just how
  we live now\, including epidemic confusion\, isolation\, hopelessness\, d
 epression\, addictions\, paranoia\, violence… yep\, we got that. But wha
 t wasn’t predicted is the spiritual ascension currently in progress. Rea
 lity is a collective consciousness experience\, which means that you can c
 hange the channel if you don’t like what you’re seeing.\n\nToo many fo
 lks are exhausting themselves trying to change other people\, in the false
  belief that everyone must agree to make a good collective. If you’re ni
 ce then you try to convince with good arguments\; if you’re not nice the
 n you just kill. But the whole approach is a total misunderstanding and in
 version of truth\, because the devil (aka negative ego\, narcissist\, fasc
 ist\, etc.) always lies.\n\nIn fact\, everyone is their own collective ins
 ide\, so the outer society is currently just a partial distorted mirror. C
 hange yourself and you change the world tuned in around you. What’s more
 \, there’s never a single current timeline to control. Everyone is their
  own timeline! Learn to uplevel your lifestyle mindset to make time your f
 lexible friend. Past\, present\, and future cooperate endlessly when you g
 row at your own pace with the Source of all life. Follow your own destiny 
 to be from the next better parallel Earth and see who’s there when you a
 rrive!\n\nIt’s my passion to explain how the living loving Universe real
 ly works. We’ll cover major points including: how your spirit human part
 nership decides what’s true for you\, why synchronicities feature in 4d 
 living\, how to handle emotions especially the 3 kinds of fear that keep p
 eople trapped in false negative systems\, the 5 steps to solving stuck pro
 blems\, and the 4 stages of permanent healing.\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selve
 s Mastery spiritual support group is free online every Sunday 11am-130pm E
 DT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. If you can’t stay
  you can get the recording. You can signup here for this meeting and visit
  www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos\, and more.\n\nBes
 t wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery\nspiritual teachin
 g and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM.com](http://www.signupISM.co
 m)
