SUMMARY:Guest Night at the Ballroom
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nCome join Melanie 
 Dale\, the Mother of Ballroom Dance in Raleigh\, for a fun evening of lear
 ning the basics of some of the ballroom dances like waltz\, foxtrot\, swin
 g and hustle.\n\nNew students and first-time guests are invited to learn a
 nd practice. Please come a little early so you are not left behind and we 
 can give you a name tag. Wear business casual and shoes that do not stick 
 to the floor. Bring a friend. You may also BYOB (beer or wine).\n\nYou mig
 ht even want to have dinner at Arepa Culture downstairs before the class. 
 The food is organic and gluten-free ... very fresh!\n\nA Step to Gold Comm
 unity Ballroom is (Located: Oak Park Shopping Center near Casa Carbone Res
 taurant )\n\nAddress Office : 6021 Glenwood Avenue\nRaleigh\, NC 27612
