SUMMARY:Salsa & Bachata Night @ Komana Brewery in Cary 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🍂 FALL INTO SAL
 SA 🍂 SEPTEMBER BIRTHDAY CELEBRATION\n\n🍁 THE SEASON IS CHANGING…BU
 T THE DANCE FLOOR IS HEATING UP! 🔥\n\nGet ready for a special night of 
 Salsa\, Bachata & Latin music as we celebrate all our September Birthdays!
  🎂💃🏽🕺🏽\n\n✨ Dance • Celebrate • Connect • Repeat 
 ✨\n\n📅 Wednesday\, Sept 2nd\n🕖 7:15 PM — Meet & Greet Mixer\n\n
 💃🏽 7:30–8:30 PM — Salsa & Bachata Lesson\nNo partner needed. Beg
 inners welcome. Come dance\, celebrate\, and make new friends in one of th
 e Triangle's friendliest Latin dance communities!\n\n🔥 8:30–11:00 PM 
 — Social Dancing\n\n🎂 9:30pm - Special Birthday Dance & Celebration f
 or all September birthdays\n\n🎧 Music by DJ Giovanni\n💃 Salsa • Ba
 chata • Merengue • Latin Hits\n\n🍻 Drink Specials • Spacious Danc
 e Floor • Free Parking\n\n🍁 Attire: Fall colors\n\n📍 Komana Brewin
 g Company\n1020 Ryan Rd.\, Cary\, NC\n\n💥 $10 BEFORE 9 PM I $15 AFTER 9
  PM\n18+ to party | 21+ to drink\nEarly Bird Tickets at Salsa4Life.com\n\n
 🍂 COME FALL INTO SALSA WITH US! 🍂\n\n🎉 Celebrating an September b
 irthday? Send us a DM so we can feature you and make your night extra spec
 ial!\n\nSalsa4Life.com\nBringing people together one dance at a time. #sal
 saincary #funthingstodoincary #salsa #bachata #dancing
