SUMMARY:Yoga + Sound Bath or come for Sound Bath only
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n💫 Join us for a
 n evening of deep relaxation.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** **This is a paid event.*
 * **There are two options: Yoga and Sound Bath or Sound Bath Only. Registr
 ation and ticket purchase information and link in description.**\n\nIn thi
 s integrative journey of self-care\, we’ll begin with gentle yoga and th
 en move into a meditative healing sound bath. Or you can come just for the
  meditative sound healing experience\, where you will be deeply immersed i
 n transformative sounds and vibrations. Crystal singing bowls tuned to eac
 h chakra\, the Chao gong\, Koshi chimes\, tuning forks and more will wash 
 over your body bringing you to a state of harmony. There is an array of es
 sential oils you can choose to use to add to your experience\, as well as 
 plant-based snacks to enjoy.\n\nThis workshop will support you to relax yo
 ur body\, calm your mind\, clear stuck energy and activate your natural he
 aling systems.\n\nPlease bring your yoga mat and water. You may also want 
 to bring blocks and a strap if you're doing yoga\, and for the sound bath 
 a blanket\, pillow\, eye covering and anything else you need to feel comfo
 rtable. Limited extra props will be available.\n\nYOGA + SOUND BATH SCHEDU
 LE\n4:45pm - Registration opens\n5:00pm - Gentle yoga\n5:50pm - Break / So
 und Bath participants come in\n6:00pm - Meditative Sound Bath\nCOST: $35 p
 er person (note the payment options at check out)\n\nSOUND BATH ONLY SCHED
 ULE\n5:50pm - Break / Sound Bath participants come in\n6:00pm - Meditative
  Sound Bath\nCOST: $25.00 per person (note the payment options at check ou
 t)\n\nIn order that we may begin on time\, please pre-register (don't worr
 y\, if something comes up you will be given credit for any future Yoga+Sou
 ndbath event) and arrive at least 5 minutes early. Walk-ins permitted as s
 pace allows. Cash and Venmo only accepted at the door.\nLocation: Unity Ho
 listic Wellness Center\, 5124 Departure Drive\, Raleigh\, NC 27616\n\nFor 
 more information and to register:\nhttps://www.staceypaige.com/service-pag
 e/yoga-sound-bath
